  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint UNDP/DPPA Program - National Capacitities on Conflict Prevention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP and the DPA collaborate on the development and implementation of conflict prevention initiatives in the field through the Joint UNDP-DPA Programme on Building National Capacities for Conflict Prevention. The Programme  strengthens conflict prevention capacities at national and local levels, and supports national architectures for peace, mediation, and dialogue. The Programme deploys Peace and Development advisers in UN country teams in 35-40 country settings.</narrative>
  </description>
